    {
      "@type": "ScholarlyArticle",
      "@id": "https://yassiralkarawi.github.io/research/digital-twin-native-ai-6g-networks.html#article",
      "headline": "Digital Twin and Native-AI Empowered 6G Networks: Architectures, Applications, Evaluation, and Open Challenges",
      "name": "Digital Twin and Native-AI Empowered 6G Networks: Architectures, Applications, Evaluation, and Open Challenges",
      "description": "A structured view of digital-twin and native-AI architectures, applications, evaluation approaches, and open challenges for 6G networks. This paper addresses the relationship between digital twins and native artificial intelligence in 6G networks. Its stated scope spans architecture, applications, evaluation and open challenges. It is a starting point for readers investigating how digital representations and AI-enabled network functions fit into future communications systems.",
