      "@type": "ScholarlyArticle",
      "@id": "https://yassiralkarawi.github.io/research/lossless-canonical-coding-fpga.html#article",
      "headline": "Lossless Canonical Coding Design with FPGA Implementation Using High-Speed Architecture",
      "name": "Lossless Canonical Coding Design with FPGA Implementation Using High-Speed Architecture",
      "description": "A high-speed FPGA architecture for lossless canonical coding, with emphasis on efficient digital implementation. The paper connects lossless canonical coding with a high-speed FPGA implementation. Its scope concerns both the coding design and its realisation as digital hardware. Readers interested in hardware-oriented data compression can use the publication record to examine the architecture and the implementation evidence reported by the authors.",
