    {
      "@type": "ScholarlyArticle",
      "@id": "https://yassiralkarawi.github.io/research/fir-filter-transient-compensation.html#article",
      "headline": "Reducing Transient Effects in FIR Digital Filters: An Efficient Compensation Technique for Enhanced Impulse Response Stability",
      "name": "Reducing Transient Effects in FIR Digital Filters: An Efficient Compensation Technique for Enhanced Impulse Response Stability",
      "description": "A compensation technique for reducing transient effects and improving impulse-response stability in finite impulse response digital filters. This work focuses on transient effects in finite impulse response digital filters and a compensation technique intended to improve impulse-response behaviour. The topic is distinct from FPGA resource optimisation: the central concern here is the filter's response over time. Consult the original paper for the compensation procedure and its evaluation conditions.",
