      "@type": "ScholarlyArticle",
      "@id": "https://yassiralkarawi.github.io/research/dca-haps-terrestrial-5850-7075.html#article",
      "headline": "Applicability of DCA in HAPS-Based Systems in the 5850–7075 MHz Band",
      "name": "Applicability of DCA in HAPS-Based Systems in the 5850–7075 MHz Band",
      "description": "An assessment of dynamic channel assignment for high-altitude platform systems sharing spectrum in the 5850–7075 MHz band. This conference paper concerns the applicability of dynamic channel assignment to high-altitude platform systems in the 5850–7075 MHz band. It belongs to the author's spectrum-sharing work on HAPS and terrestrial communications. Its focus is channel assignment, distinct from the related paper on automatic transmit-power control.",
