      "headline": "Utilizing ATPC Scheme to Facilitate Sharing Between HAPS and Terrestrial in 5.7 GHz Band",
      "name": "Utilizing ATPC Scheme to Facilitate Sharing Between HAPS and Terrestrial in 5.7 GHz Band",
      "description": "Application of automatic transmit power control to facilitate spectrum sharing between high-altitude platform and terrestrial systems in the 5.7 GHz band. This conference paper considers automatic transmit-power control as a means of facilitating spectrum sharing between HAPS and terrestrial systems. The publication title specifies the 5.7 GHz band. Its power-control focus distinguishes it from the related HAPS paper on dynamic channel assignment.",
